\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Russia c.bank buys dollars for 4th day -dealers\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrei Ostroukh and Toni Vorobyova   \par \uc2 583 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 08:19\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds value of \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , updates with closing prices)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, March 24 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market for a fourth session running on Tuesday, buying dollars to keep a lid on the rouble's rally to two-month highs, dealers said.\par \par \uc2 The rouble, aided like other emerging \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  by improved global risk appetite, remained on a strong footing despite a bout of profit-taking in Russian stock markets <.MCX><.IRTS> -- which hit 4-1/2 month highs on Monday -- and on oil prices.\par \par \uc2 The rouble firmed to a two-month high of 38.57 versus a euro-dollar basket, according to Reuters data <RUS=MCX>, before closing little changed on the day at 38.70.\par \par \uc2 "The market's a happier place again, spring has sprung and everyone is short dollar-rouble again," said a trader at a foreign bank in Moscow.\par \par \uc2 "It (rouble strengthening) probably will continue as long as stocks and oil stay bid. The positioning is still quite light."\par \par \uc2 The rouble had lost around a third of its value in a six-month slide to adjust to Russia's worst economic outlook in a decade, part of a crisis that has put pressure on its political elite.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent tens of billions of dollars keeping the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation gradual and it has pledged to keep the rouble within a 26-41 range versus the basket.\par \par \uc2 But it has also said it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prevent excessive volatility and officials have indicated that they see current exchange rate levels as appropriate given the present price of the country's key export, oil.\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to be moving its bid by around 5 kopecks at a time -- at first buying foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  around 38.70 roubles versus the basket, and then moving gradually to 38.59-38.60 by mid-session.\par \par \uc2 Dealers estimated Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  at $1.5-2.0 billion, taking the value of dollar purchases for the last four trading days to around $4.5 billion.\par \par \uc2 "I don't think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has any desire for a strong appreciation of the rouble," said another dealer.\par \par \uc2 WEAKER IS BETTER?\par \par \uc2 A weaker \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  benefits exporters but Economy Minister Elvira Nabiullina on Tuesday cautioned against excessive moves.\par \par \uc2 "There is now a real risk of a global devaluation race due to attempts by individual countries to stimulate economic growth," she said.\par \par \uc2 "Triggering that process may become as dangerous for the world economy and trade as direct protectionism."\par \par \uc2 Analysts say the upward pressure on the rouble gives the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  an opportunity to replenish gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves -- down by over a third from their August peak to $376 billion.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's own measures on Tuesday contributed to tighter liquidity and demand for roubles. It cut the amount on offer at its first repo auction of the day to 10 billion roubles, the lowest since limits were introduced in September. The daily cap for \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was set at zero for the first time since January.\par \par \uc2 However, dealers said such liquidity restrictions were partly offset by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble selling \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , as well as by the injection of budget funds into the economy. (Editing by Patrick Graham)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLES/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|O|OIL|BNX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PEN|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090324e53o000d7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
