\par\par \b \uc2 DJ Russia Ctrl Bank Buys $1.5 Bln To Stop Ruble From Rapid Rise\b0\par\par\uc2 225 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 23 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 16:34\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2009, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.  \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--Strengthening pressures on \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ruble forced the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the third consecutive day Monday in an attempt to prevent the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from rising rapidly.\par \par \uc2 Local traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought some $1.5 billion during the day, stepping in when the ruble reached around RUB38.80 against a euro-dollar basket the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  uses for fixing the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily rate.\par \par \uc2 After the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the ruble closed at RUB38.83 against the basket, virtually unchanged from Friday.\par \par \uc2 Stable oil prices - Russia's chief export - which have remained above $50 a barrel in recent days, and continued pressure on the dollar on international markets have been pushing the ruble higher.\par \par \uc2 "We should see some more \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the coming days to slow down the process of the appreciation," said Ilya Kolpukov a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trader at Moscow's Trust Investment Bank.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said in late January it will step in whenever it deems such a move necessary to prevent rapid fluctuations in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate.\par \par \uc2 Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.micex.ru"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 