\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank says no  \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions \highlight\uc2  in Feb\b0\par\par\uc2 143 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2009\par 15:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, March 5 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Thursday it had carried no \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to support the rouble in February after selling $30 billion in January.\par \par \uc2 New \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's data showed the bank had bought $0.86 billion in February to replenish Russia's oil wealth funds. In January it bought $3.56 billion for the same purposes with net sales amounting to $34.16 billion.\par \par \uc2 In January the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had wrapped up the gradual devaluation of the rouble, which required heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 forex interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and set a floor for the rouble's exchange rate at 41 roubles to the dollar/euro basket <RUS=MCX>. (Reporting by Dmitry Zhdannikov; editing by Gleb Bryanski)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /SALES (URGENT)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090305e535001aa\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
