\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3-Rouble showdown looms as  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  cbank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  again\b0\par\par\uc2 By Gleb Bryanski and Andrei Ostroukh   \par \uc2 767 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 Januar 2009\par 13:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds Dvorkovich quote, c.bank \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 )\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 29 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble slipped to a historic low on Thursday, sparking another confrontation between markets and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as players pushed the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  towards the weaker edge of its trading corridor.\par \par \uc2 The bank last week took advantage of corporate tax deadlines that stoked temporary demand for roubles to try to end 2-1/2 months of gradual devaluation, setting limits for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at 26 to 41 roubles to the euro-dollar basket.\par \par \uc2 But its slide has since resumed and bankers say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's resolve to stabilise the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to be tested.\par \par \uc2 "For now, everybody is playing to test the ... boundary of 41 roubles. The big question is whether or not it rests there," said Viktor Kholoshnoi, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Gazprombank.\par \par \uc2 Analysts expect Russia's economic slowdown to create severe social tensions in coming months and Prime Minister Vladimir Putin's government has given high priority to avoiding a repeat of the rouble's 1998 collapse.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the rouble fell another 2.6 percent to 39.75 against the basket and 4.9 percent to 34.93 against the dollar. Dealers estimated the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has used a third of its reserves defending the rouble, spent around $3-4 billion during the day on countering the decline. "It looks like the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is getting in the way, today at around 39.75," said Denis Korshilov at Citibank.\par \par \uc2 Kremlin's top aide on economic matters, Arkady Dvorkovich, told Reuters in Davos the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is trying to stay out of the market as much as possible to allow the rouble to find an equilibrium level within its trading band.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has said it is prepared to defend the trading band's floor as long as the price for oil, Russia's main export commodity, does not fall to $30 a barrel. It said that if oil rises to $50 the rouble could strengthen.\par \par \uc2 Russia's Urals export blend of oil traded at $41.50 on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 ENERGY PRICES\par \par \uc2 Giving oil price guidance for the rouble de-facto pegs it to Urals, which trades at a discount to main blends.\par \par \uc2 Speaking at the World Economic Forum in Davos, Putin said the world needed to return to stable and predictable energy prices that reflected supply and demand rather than speculation.\par \par \uc2 When the crisis began Russia's top leaders first said there would be no devaluation but later altered their tune, saying there would be no sharp fluctuations.\par \par \uc2 Russians' earnings and savings have rapidly lost value against the dollar, and the media have cautiously begun to raise questions about policy, which may give ammunition to advocates of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and capital controls. "A transition from a mantra 'there will be no devaluation' to a mantra 'what did you want at such an oil price' required at least some explanation but there wasn't one," wrote columnist Alexander Privalov in Expert magazine.\par \par \uc2 Dvorkovich said Russia was looking for new ways to keep dollars inside the country. Last year Russia offered commercial banks the option of parking foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to stop capital flight.\par \par \uc2 CREDIBILITY AT STAKE The end of major corporate tax payments has freed up speculators to try and test the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  boundaries. High volumes in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  repo auctions suggested banks were still holding onto their \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves.\par \par \uc2 Analysts are divided with some, like \uc2 BNP Paribas\uc2 , saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will spend "an infinite amount of dollars" to defend the rouble while others, like \uc2 Commerzbank\uc2 , reckon the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's statements "lacked credibility".\par \par \uc2 "It is disappointing to see that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has thus far been unwilling or unable to take sufficient steps to cut off the supply of liquidity to bolster the credibility of its new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime," said Rory MacFarquhar from \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  as well as traders closely watch exchange rates priced in internationally traded non-deliverable forward (NDF) contracts for the rouble, which for now show that devaluation expectations are receding.\par \par \uc2 "It looks like we are watching one of the last speculative attacks. Our opinion is based on a lower cost for the rouble position hedge through NDFs," \uc2 Bank of Moscow\uc2 's analysts said in a research note. (Additional reporting by Guy Faulconbridge in Davos; Reporting by Andrei Ostroukh and Gleb Bryanski; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/ (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN|AFA|CSA|LBY|RWSA|RWS|REULB|GNS   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090129e51t001ii\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
