\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 4-Rouble at record low as  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  faces up to cheap oil\b0\par\par\uc2 By Toni Vorobyova and Andrey Ostroukh   \par \uc2 847 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Januar 2009\par 09:36\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2009 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Updates with day's \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and futures trades, details)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Jan 15 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rouble hit historic lows versus the dollar and the euro on Thursday as the authorities sped ahead with a devaluation of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to adjust to lower oil prices and the worst economic outlook in a decade.\par \par \uc2 The once-buoyant Russian economy is teetering towards recession because of a slump in demand for its energy and commodity exports and flight from emerging markets.\par \par \uc2 Moscow has been forced to embark on a path of controlled rouble weakening, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  losing a fifth of its value versus a euro-dollar basket since August.\par \par \uc2 Some analysts reckon the rouble may now be nearing its bottom, though they expect several more mini-devaluations in coming days and weeks. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, however, are betting it will lose another fifth of its value in the next 12 months.\par \par \uc2 A \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official confirmed the rouble's trading band had been widened for the fourth time this year on Thursday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slipped to 36.82 versus the basket.\par \par \uc2 "The main focus is to adjust the rouble to the lower oil price, to balance the balance of payments and to preserve some reserves, which have already fallen significantly," said Yaroslav Lissovolik, chief strategist at \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2 . "That is the main reason why they are speeding up the weakening of the rouble ... It is possible they are hoping to conclude the devaluations this month," he added, forecasting another 7-8 percent weakening versus the basket by end-January.\par \par \uc2 The rouble has lost more in the first five trading days of 2009 than had been expected for the whole year: a December poll showed it ending 2009 at 36.24 to the basket.\par \par \uc2 ABOVE THE RED LINE, BUT NEARING BOTTOM?\par \par \uc2 The rouble weakened past the 32 mark versus the dollar for the first time since Russia began to open its economy to market forces in the 1990s. The dollar rose to 32.35 roubles. The euro hit a record 42.55 roubles.\par \par \uc2 President Dmitry Medvedev has described 31-32 roubles per dollar as a "red mark" which Russians last saw relatively recently and are thus ready to accept psychologically. Despite the long-term lows, Russia's gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have enabled it to keep the depreciation controlled in contrast to 1998 when the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  slumped 70 percent versus the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Still, mindful of that time, Russians have been shifting their spare cash into dollars and euros. Capital outflows from the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  hit a record $130 billion last year.\par \par \uc2 As authorities strove to cushion the exchange rate from capital flight, Russian reserves posted their first yearly fall in a decade to stand at $426.5 billion on Jan. 9.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday alone the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent $7 billion to $8 billion defending the rouble at the new weaker rate, according to dealers' estimates. That takes estimated \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the current week, which started on Sunday, to over $20 billion.\par \par \uc2 Before the current crisis, Russia had been moving slowly towards a floating rouble exchange for roughly 2011. The latest speeding up of the depreciation process has made some market participants wonder whether a free float could happen sooner.\par \par \uc2 Trades in rouble/dollar futures on the MICEX exchange topped 9,000 deals on Thursday, a third more than the last record. One-year non-deliverable forwards (NDFs) now show the rouble at around 41.55 to the dollar from 37.34 on Monday.\par \par \uc2 But analysts are starting to talk of the possibility of rouble bottoming in coming weeks as it gets nearer to reflecting the oil price fall and moves of other commodity \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "If you look at the rouble versus other emerging market \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  which are very much driven by commodities, such as the rand or real, the rouble has done much of what it needs to do already," said David Hauner at \uc2 Bank of America\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The correlation between the rouble and oil prices shows that the rouble has now undershot," he added, saying a 1 percent move in oil historically translated into a 0.3 percent move in rouble/dollar.\par \par \uc2 By that measure, the rouble has already caught up with the 60 percent plus slump in oil prices since August.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  depreciation also increases the value of Russia's oil revenues in rouble terms as Moscow braces for the fact that the key export may be worth as little as $32 a barrel this year.\par \par \uc2 That could lead to a budget deficit of 4 trillion roubles, or some 10 percent of gross domestic product (GDP) assuming a dollar rate of 34 roubles, Interfax reported on Thursday.\par \par \uc2 A weaker rouble contributed to imports hitting a nine month low in November, ensuring that Russia's dollar trade balance stays in surplus despite sharply falling exports. (Additional reporting by Yelena Fabrichnaya; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/ (UPDATE 4)|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN|AFA|CSA|LBY|RWSA|RWS|REULB|GNS   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020090115e51f000om\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
