\par\par \b \uc2 Russian markets -- Factors to Watch on Nov 12\b0\par\par\uc2 766 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 November 2008\par 08:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Nov 12 (Reuters) - Here are events and news stories that could move Russian markets today.\par \par \uc2  You can reach us on: +7 495 775 1242\par \par \uc2  STOCKS CALL (Contributions to moscow.newsroom@reuters.com):\par \par \uc2 Alfa-Bank\uc2 : Those Russian stocks that trade in London (MICEX is closed for the day) are likely to see further declines today in line with weak global markets and investor concerns about the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to sustain its new, 1 percent weaker rouble level. Olma: expects the RTS <.IRTS> index to open lower following global stock indexes and oil prices.\par \par \uc2  EVENTS [RU-DIA] (All times GMT):\par \par \uc2  DOHA - Russia, Iran, and Qatar will hold talks on gas cooperation\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Egyptian Prime Minister Ahmed Nazif visits Russia\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Finnish Prime Minister Matti Vanhanen to meet his Russian counterpart, Vladimir Putin\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Secretary general of Council of Europe Terry Davis to visit for discussions with Russian Foreign Minister Sergei Lavrov on the Russia-Georgia conflict\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Cuban Foreign Minister Felipe Perez Roque visits\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Russian Finance Minister Alexei Kudrin to address Federation Council upper house of parliament on budget strategy to 2023\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Russian First Deputy Prime Minister Igor Shuvalov to speak on measures to promote small and medium-sized businesses\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW - Drug maker \uc2 Veropharm\uc2   to announce Jan-Sept financial results  MOSCOW - Home electronics retailer M.video  to hold a conference call (1300)\par \par \uc2  IN THE PAPERS [PRESS/RU]:\par \par \uc2  Business daily Kommersant reports that Russia, Iran and Qatar will set up a joint venture to produce and sell gas when top officials and executives from the three states hold gas cooperation talks on Wednesday in Doha.\par \par \uc2  Vedomosti business daily runs an interview with German drugmaker Stada  Chief Executive Hartmut Retzlaff, who says the company has enough resources to fund its development, including acquisitions, despite the financial crisis.\par \par \uc2  TOP STORIES IN RUSSIA AND THE CIS [RU-NEWS]:  TOP NEWS: \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Russia's Medvedev submits draft law on term     [ID:nLB392724]\par * Russia signals a softer stand on missiles       [ID:nLB554188]\par * EU-Russia pact talks may resume Nov 25          [ID:nLB502923]\par * Russia weakens rouble support, stocks plunge    [ID:nLB514655]\par * Kazakh govt, banks agree $3.47 bln bailout      [ID:nLB704742]\par  \par  COMPANIES/MARKETS:\par * \f28 \uc2 \f2 Gazprom\f28 \uc2 \f2 , \f28 \uc2 \f2 BASF\f28 \uc2 \f2  in talks on gas refining projects [ID:nLA18397]\par * Russia, Iran, Qatar to form big gas JV - paper  [ID:nLC348207]\par * Oil, rouble, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Uralkali\f28 \uc2 \f2  pressure Russian assets   [ID:nLB300914]\par * Russia c.bank ups rates to fight flight         [ID:nLB459096]\par * Russia c.bank defends rbl at new, weaker level  [ID:nLB67914]\par * Russia c.bank says widened rouble trading band  [ID:nLB434666]\par * FACTBOX-Key moves in Russian rbl exchange rate  [ID:nLB222365]\par * Russia's MICEX halts stock trading until Thurs  [ID:nLB321921]\par * \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  loss to push MTS Q3 net profit - poll     [ID:nLA142132]\par * \f28 \uc2 \f2 Sberbank\f28 \uc2 \f2  saw record Oct deposit outflows        [ID:nLB625715]\par * Russian investment banks slash staff            [ID:nLB351451]\par * Investors see asset grab in potash mine probe   [ID:nLB374648]\par * Russia mortgage agency plans to help banks      [ID:nLB228654]\par * Russian developer RTM net fa