\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Russia allows no  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  swaps with c.bank for 2nd day\b0\par\par\uc2 521 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 2008\par 18:13\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Recasts with \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 , changed swap limit, poll)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Oct 31 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday raised a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap limit used to ease depreciation pressures on the rouble, even though dealers estimate it has spent around $5-6 billion on supporting the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far this week.\par \par \uc2 The daily limit for \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  swaps with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  -- introduced last week to deter \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators -- was originally set at zero on Friday, but later in the session it was revised up to 60 billion roubles ($2.26 billion).\par \par \uc2 Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was balancing the use of swap limits as a tool to support the rouble against the use of swaps by some market participants as a key source of liquidity.\par \par \uc2 The raised limit "is linked to the sharp rise in exchange-traded \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  swap rates, which opened at 50 basis points and then reached 200 basis points. If you translate that into roubles, banks were ready to pay (interest rates of) 50 percent," said Stanislav Yarushevichus, head of trading at ING in Moscow.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  which do not include the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  are unaffected by these daily limits.\par \par \uc2 Dealers estimated \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the start of the week at $5-6 billion, down from $13 billion the previous period.\par \par \uc2 However, the total for this week could yet increase as Saturday Nov. 1 is a working day in Russia due to public holidays at the start of the following week.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  have taken a big toll on \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves, which fell a record $31 billion in the week to Oct. 24 to dip below $500 billion for the first time in eight months.\par \par \uc2 The bank has battled to prevent the rouble from weakening beyond the 30.40-41 level against a basket of 0.45 euros and 0.55 dollars <RUS=MCX>.\par \par \uc2 On Thursday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  recommended banks keep their average level of foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  denominated assets in the final months of the year at the level they were between Aug. 1 and Oct. 25 and said compliance would be considered in deciding how much the banks can borrow in collateral free loans.\par \par \uc2 "Due to this measure local demand for foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been reduced," said Yarushevichus.\par \par \uc2 A Reuters poll published on Friday showed the rouble staying around the 30.40 mark for the rest of this year before weakening to 32.20 during the course of 2009. [ID:nLV443087]\par \par \uc2 "For now I think the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will support the rouble to avoid panic. But then it will gradually let it depreciate," said Elena Sharipova, analyst at Renaissance Capital.\par \par \uc2 "Next year there are objective reasons (for a depreciation). The reduced capital inflows and reduced trade surplus will mean that there are fewer dollars in the economy ... and the rouble will become cheaper. Slowing economic growth will reduce direct investment, all these things are connected," she said. (Reporting by Andrei Ostroukh and Toni Vorobyova; Editing by Ruth Pitchford)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-SWAP/ (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|E|RBN|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081031e4av000w5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
