\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE: \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  Ruble Weakens More As Ctrl Bk Doesn't  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 370 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 September 2008\par 17:27\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par    (Adds background, analyst comments) \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 LONDON (Dow Jones)--The Russian ruble Thursday extended the previous day's sharp losses as the Russian \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  failed to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  yet again to support it.\f28 \par \par \uc2 The ruble weakened to RUB30.41 Thursday against the 55%-dollar and 45%-euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket - its weakest level since February 2007 when the bank introduced the current composition of the basket to measure the exchange rate. Wednesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had weakened to RUB30.22.\par \par \uc2 Only a month ago, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  when the ruble breached RUB30.10 as investors fled Russian markets in reaction to the military conflict in Georgia. This led market participants to assume this was the bank's lower support level.\par \par \uc2 "Whatever the reason for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's absence might be, its new neglect is a bad signal for the ruble," said Ulrich Leuchtmann, head of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  research at \uc2 Commerzbank AG\uc2  in Frankfurt.\par \par \uc2 He said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's reserves are still comfortably high at $582.5 billion, which suggests that the bank has the means to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  but has chosen not to.\par \par \uc2 "The bank's motivation might be that they don't want to waste reserves but expect the market to normalize soon, even without \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," Leuchtmann said.\par \par \uc2 The Georgia conflict, lower oil prices and a stronger dollar have all put pressure on the ruble in recent weeks.\par \par \uc2 But analysts at Goldman Sachs Holdings Inc. in London said they believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  "will ultimately bring the ruble basket toward the strong end of the band, which will help fight inflation."\par \par \uc2 Russia's ruble was pegged in a tight range against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket until this summer when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  first allowed for a series of small moves expanding the band.\par \par \uc2 But Leutchtmann warned that the recent swift depreciation moves "have opened a Pandora's box which might be difficult and costly to close at some point in the future when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  decides that the depreciation is sufficient."\par \par \uc2 -By Rebecca Bundhun, Dow Jones Newswires; +44 (0) 207 842 9250; rebecca.bundhun@dowjones.com\par \par \uc2 (Lidia Kelly in Moscow contributed to this report) [ 04-09-08 1527GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080904e494000pl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
