\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  made only planned  \highlight22\uc2 FX interventions \highlight\uc2  in July\b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 August 2008\par 12:23\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Aug 8 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday it had carried out only planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market in July, which amounted to $24.3 billion and 1.41 billion euros.\par \par \uc2 In June, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  bought $17.6 billion, of which only $8.3 billion were planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It also bought 107.8 million euros in the domestic \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which was also planned.\par \par \uc2 In May, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said it would begin daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as part of paving the way for an eventual free-float of the rouble and a move to inflation-targeting monetary policy.\par \par \uc2 In the past, it had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rouble stable against a basket of 0.45 euros and 0.55 dollars, but from mid-May it said the aim of regular planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would be linked to distributing the money destined for \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's two oil funds, which store up windfall crude revenues.\par \par \uc2 Both the stabilisation fund and the national wealth fund are split into 45 percent dollars, 45 percent euros and 10 percent sterling.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's planned \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  involve selling the rouble within its trading corridor against the dollar/euro basket.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  lowered its bid level on the basket to 29.51 in June and to 29.25 in July, effectively allowing rouble appreciation.\par \par \uc2 The scope for increased volatility in the rouble market was highlighted this week, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthening to a new high of 29.26 versus the basket on Monday and then staging a sharp retreat to nearly 29.63 on Friday. (Reporting by Gleb Bryanski, writing by Toni Vorobyova; Editing by Gerrard Raven)\par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-CBANK/ (UPDATE 1)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080808e488001uf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
