uc2 - Russia's navy has renewed its presence in the Arctic Ocean archipelago of Svalbard, known by Russians as Spitzbergen.\par \par \uc2 - Russian national carrier Aeroflot is planning to place adverts on its planes.\par \par \uc2 VREMYA NOVOSTEI\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.vremya.ru"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 www.vremya.ru}}}\par \par \uc2 - The paper has published an interview with Russian Deputy Foreign Minister Andrei Denisov, where he speaks about ambassadors meeting with Russian President Dmitry Medvedev.\par \par \uc2 LANGEN|G|RBN|REVU|RNP|PGE|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080715e47f000iw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
