\par\par \b \uc2 Russian  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  To Increase  \highlight22\uc2 Currency Interventions \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 120 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Mai 2008\par 14:08\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said Wednesday that it would launch new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  as part of a policy switch to target inflation.\par \par \uc2 The sharp rise in consumer prices over the last 12 months has become a major political theme and featured prominently in a speech last week by new Prime Minister Vladimir Putin.\par \par \uc2 The bank said the volume of the new \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  would depend on market conditions and \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's balance of payments data, but didn't give further details.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Web site: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.cbr.ru"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.cbr.ru}}}\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew Langley, Dow Jones Newswires; +7 495 974 80 55; andrew.langley@dowjones.com [ 14-05-08 1220GMT ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020080514e45e000xh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
