\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Russia c.bank moves to fend off rouble speculators\b0\par\par\uc2 By Gleb Bryanski and Dmitry Zhdannikov   \par \uc2 710 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 Mai 2008\par 14:18\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds c.bank comments, dealers, analysts)\par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, May 14 (Reuters) - Russia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it would begin daily \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market as of May 14 to discourage \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  speculators and make the rouble's exchange rate more flexible.\par \par \uc2 The move followed weeks of intense rumours the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will allow the rouble to appreciate after the inauguration of President Dmitry Medvedev to curb inflation and protect popularity of the new leader and his predecessor and political mentor Vladimir Putin, who became prime minister.\par \par \uc2 "We believe this measure will demotivate speculative capital from entering the Russian money market, fixing the profit and leaving," First Deputy Chairman of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Alexei Ulyukayev told Interfax news agency.\par \par \uc2 Ulyukayev said a more flexible exchange rate policy will make more difficult for speculators to calculate the exchange rate at a given date, decreasing the volatility of capital flows, which make Russia's balance of payments less predictable.\par \par \uc2 The rouble exchange rate is the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main anti-inflation weapon and with annual inflation running at over 14 percent going long on the rouble has become a popular trade with major international players.\par \par \uc2 The bank said in a statement its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy would now be guided by the situation in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the country's trade balance and the federal budget. It said the move was also part of a transition to an inflation targeting regime.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the rouble stable against a basket made of 0.55 dollars and 0.45 euros. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has bought about $30 billion since the start of the year.\par \par \uc2 "If earlier we saw that the exchange rate de facto hovered close to one of the ends of the corridor, most often the lower end, now we will see the exchange rate fluctuating inside the corridor," Ulyukayev said.\par \par \uc2 "EVIL CARRY-TRADERS"\par \par \uc2 The rouble surprisingly weakened to the basket in the last two days and dealers told Reuters they suspected there could have been a leak about the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's upcoming move.\par \par \uc2 The rouble closed at 29.73 against the dollar/euro basket on Wednesday, calculated on a daily weighted average basis versus 29.65 on Tuesday and 0.4 percent weaker than the 29.61 currently seen by the market as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's bid level.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has never disclosed its corridor, but market players say it is set at 29.61-29.91 per basket.\par \par \uc2 Sources familiar with the policy told Reuters the move will also help the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  plan better its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases for two oil funds which collect windfall oil revenues. They also said the new policy will help smooth liquidity fluctuations.\par \par \uc2 Ulyukayev told Interfax the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  carried out its first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Wednesday buying several hundred million dollars and promised the regulator will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily with volumes increasing during corporate tax payments.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  earlier dismissed the appreciation talk as "irrational" while Putin told the parliament the country could live with double digit inflation for some years, dampening appreciation expectations. "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is creating some uncertainty, it could increase weakness in the short term and shake out positioning, then the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could potentially revalue later," said Shahin Vallee, emerging markets strategist at \uc2 BNP Paribas.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's main task is to get carry-traders off the market, they see them as the main evil and want to cut their hands off," said Nikolai Kashcheyev, analyst at state-owned VTB. Finance Minister Alexei Kudrin and Ulyukayev said earlier this year Russia may move to an inflation targeting regime in the medium term once its huge trade surplus shrinks.\par \par \uc2 The regime will give the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  more leverage over inflation with its interest rates policy but will require the regulator to abandon its managed float policy and allow the rouble to float freely.\par \par \uc2 For an instant view in new policy click on [ID:nL14843227]. (Additional reporting by Yelena Fabrichnaya) (Reporting by Dmitry Zhdannikov and Gleb Bryanski)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 RUSSIA\b0 \highlight\uc2 -CBANK/\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTIONS\b0 \highlight\uc2  (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|BNX|RNP   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080514e45e001h7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
