\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 3- \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support rouble   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Douglas Busvine and Gleb Bryanski   \par \uc2 610 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 August 2007\par 10:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds Gref on inflation, second repo auction)   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, Aug 21 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Tuesday to support a weakening rouble and pumped fresh liquidity into the banking system as foreign investors cut their exposure to risky assets in a global credit crunch.   \par \par \uc2 Typically, the  \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Russia\uc2  is seen bidding for dollars as it offsets upward pressure on the rouble stemming from the half a billion petrodollars a day earned by the world's No.2 oil exporter.   \par \par \uc2 But this time the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in as a dollar seller when the rouble eased by over half a percent against the dollar/euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket it targets under its managed float. Analysts said the investor pullback may actually help Russian policy makers in their fight against inflation. Economy Minister German Gref predicted that consumer price growth would hit the 8 percent official target this year.   \par \par \uc2 The rouble's fall wiped out last week's gains and pared back its advance against the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket, composed of 55 U.S. cents and 45 euro cents, to just 0.6 percent so far this year.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers said non-residents trading through several large banks were closing their short positions in the basket. Some market watchers expected the rouble weakness to be short-lived. "The rouble will come back within the coming days. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will make sure of that," said Lars Rasmussen, analyst at  \uc2 Danske Bank.\par \par \uc2 LIQUIDITY INJECTION   \par \par \uc2 Russian stocks fell by up to 2 percent and overnight money market rates remained high as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  injected a total of 87.8 billion roubles ($3.4 billion) into the banking system at rates of 6.05 and 6.1 percent via one-day repo auctions.   \par \par \uc2 Russia's authorities are having to walk a fine line between keeping the financial system liquid and containing money pressures that threaten this year's inflation target.   \par \par \uc2 Economists say the latest capital outflows weighing on the rouble, after record inflows early this year, could offset price pressures. "These outflows could be a blessing in disguise," said Yaroslav Lissovolik, chief economist at  \uc2 Deutsche UFG\uc2  in Moscow.   \par \par \uc2 Gref said consumer prices rose by 0.2 percent in the first two weeks of August but should then stabilise for the rest of the month.   \par \par \uc2 "I think we have every chance of meeting our forecast target (for 2007) of 8 percent," Gref told President Vladimir Putin at a meeting, according to Interfax news agency.   \par \par \uc2 Analysts said Russia's financial system was feeling some of the strain stemming from the crisis in the risky U.S. subprime mortgage sector, but is now much better able to cope than a few years ago.   \par \par \uc2 "This is a more normal market. It's getting more mature," said Evgeny Gavrilenkov, chief economist at Troika Dialog.   \par \par \uc2 Three years ago, the forced closure of two small banks was enough to trigger a run that forced the owners of  \uc2 Alfa-Bank\uc2 , Russia's largest private bank, to inject hundreds of millions of dollars in fresh capital to steady the ship.   \par \par \uc2 Now, Russia has a deposit insurance scheme, its \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has $420 billion in reserves and it was quick last week to relaunch repo \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  dormant since March to allow banks to pledge securities in return for ready cash.   \par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been pretty quick to act and so far we aren't seeing any signs of major strains being felt by any of the major banks," said Lissovolik.   \par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/ (UPDATE 3)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|E|BNX|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070821e38l000k4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
