\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Rouble slips, market suspects Rosneft dlr buying   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Gleb Bryanski   \par \uc2 514 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juni 2007\par 10:22\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds Rosneft statement, Ignatyev comments on reserves)   \par \par \uc2 MOSCOW, June 27 (Reuters) - The Russian rouble eased against its dollar/euro \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  basket on Wednesday, giving back some gains from the day before, as a single buyer was spotted scooping up dollars.   \par \par \uc2 Dealers and analysts suggested the dollar buyer could have acted on behalf of state-controlled oil firm Rosneft which could be buying dollars so it could retire foreign debt.   \par \par \uc2 The basket, 55 percent of which is dollars and 45 percent euros, closed at 29.8478 roubles, up 0.16 percent.   \par \par \uc2 That followed a 0.5 percent rouble revaluation on Tuesday as the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which runs a managed float, sought to combat inflation pressures.   \par \par \uc2 "There is active dollar buying going on at the moment," said Pyotr Milovanov, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at Metallinvestbank.   \par \par \uc2 Yevgeny Nadorshin, analyst at Trust Bank, added: "One can suggest that a single market player is collecting the cash for Rosneft."   \par \par \uc2 Rosneft said on Wednesday it had received 237 billion roubles ($9.2 billion) of debt owed to it by bankrupt oil company YUKOS and that would use the cash to pay off debt.   \par \par \uc2 Rosneft raised $22 billion in short-term loans from a consortium of international banks earlier this year to buy assets of bankrupt oil firm YUKOS at a series of auctions.   \par \par \uc2 The bankrupt firm's receiver announced on Wednesday he had started paying back 400 billion roubles ($15.52 billion) of YUKOS debt to creditors. YUKOS owes Rosneft about $10 billion.   \par \par \uc2 For a Reuters interview with Rosneft finance vice president Peter O'Brien on debt repayment, click on [ID:nL27878831].   \par \par \uc2 Dollar volumes at MICEX \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange stood at $4.2 billion, compared with about $3 billion for all of Tuesday. Dealers said they the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  appeared to be staying out of the market.   \par \par \uc2 "Looks like the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not present," Nadorshin said. "For some reasons the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not want to sell its dollars to this single player."   \par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  guided the rouble about 0.5 percent higher on Tuesday against the basket in a revaluation aimed at keeping inflation within its annual target. Wednesday's bounce left analysts wondering why the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not yet \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to keep the basket stable. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  runs a managed float of the rouble and buys foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , mainly dollars, flowing into Russia as companies repatriate export revenues and raise funds in the international market.   \par \par \uc2 The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market largely follows international \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 .   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  runs the world's third-largest gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves and about half of its \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  holdings are in dollars. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's chairman, Sergei Ignatyev, told parliament on Wednesday he expected reserves growth to slow.   \par \par \uc2 "Imports are growing, exports are growing too but at a slower rate, therefore our forecast is for moderate growth of gold and \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," Ignatyev said.   \par \par \uc2 RUSSIA-ROUBLE/BASKET (UPDATE 2)|LANGEN|ABN|M|D|RBN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020070627e36r000jk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
