\par\par \b \uc2 Swedbank OAO Subject To Public Authority  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 ,  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 223 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 Juni 2007\par 09:35\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2007 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 Edited Press Release   \par \par \uc2 STOCKHOLM (Dow Jones)--Swedbank (SWED-A.SK) said Thursday that Swedbank OAO is subject to public authority \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . It said the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has issued an order to restrict certain \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Swedbank OAO in Russia for a period of three months.   \par \par \uc2 It said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  quotes violations of the federal law and the normative acts of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  on prevention of illicitly acquired funds.   \par \par \uc2 The order is issued as a result of an audit performed during March to April this year, Swedbank said, and the following restrictions mainly concerns the area of correspondent banking, carrying out \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , attracting new business and interbank loans.   \par \par \uc2 "We are currently establishing the further circumstances and have also requested clarifications. The order was unexpected and we are of course ready to take necessary measures," said Swedbank CEO Jan Lid\u233\'00\'E9n. "Meanwhile we continue to serve clients with respect to \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  not restricted by the order and to minimize the effects for our clients," Lid\u233\'00\'E9n said.   \par \par \uc2 Swedbank is requested to adjust its \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  quoted in the order and to further enhance internal control systems, it said.   \par \par \uc2 Swedbank said Swedbank Russia has three branches and a portfolio of approximately SEK4B. The total number of employees is 238, it said. [ 07-06-07 0735GMT ]   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020070607e367000f4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
